{"page":350,"verses":[{"verse_key":"24:1","surah":24,"ayah":1,"ar_uthmani":" سُورَةٌ أَنزَلْنَـٰهَا وَفَرَضْنَـٰهَا وَأَنزَلْنَا فِيهَآ ءَايَـٰتٍۭ بَيِّنَـٰتٍ لَّعَلَّكُمْ تَذَكَّرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"This is a sura We have sent down and made obligatory: We have sent down clear revelations in it, so that you may take heed.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"سُورَةٌ","en_gloss":"A Surah ","transliteration":"sūratun","verse_key":"24:1"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنزَلْنَـٰهَا","en_gloss":"We (have) sent it down","transliteration":"anzalnāhā","verse_key":"24:1"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَفَرَضْنَـٰهَا","en_gloss":"and We (have) made it obligatory","transliteration":"wafaraḍnāhā","verse_key":"24:1"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَأَنزَلْنَا","en_gloss":"and We (have) revealed","transliteration":"wa-anzalnā","verse_key":"24:1"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِيهَآ","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"24:1"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتٍۭ","en_gloss":"Verses","transliteration":"āyātin","verse_key":"24:1"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بَيِّنَـٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"clear","transliteration":"bayyinātin","verse_key":"24:1"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَّعَلَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"so that you may","transliteration":"laʿallakum","verse_key":"24:1"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَذَكَّرُونَ","en_gloss":"take heed","transliteration":"tadhakkarūna","verse_key":"24:1"},{"pos":10,"ar":"١","en_gloss":"(1)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"24:1"}]},{"verse_key":"24:2","surah":24,"ayah":2,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلزَّانِيَةُ وَٱلزَّانِى فَٱجْلِدُوا۟ كُلَّ وَٰحِدٍ مِّنْهُمَا مِا۟ئَةَ جَلْدَةٍ ۖ وَلَا تَأْخُذْكُم بِهِمَا رَأْفَةٌ فِى دِينِ ٱللَّهِ إِن كُنتُمْ تُؤْمِنُونَ بِٱللَّهِ وَٱلْيَوْمِ ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ ۖ وَلْيَشْهَدْ عَذَابَهُمَا طَآئِفَةٌ مِّنَ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Strike the adulteress and the adulterer one hundred times. Do not let compassion for them keep you from carrying out God’s law––if you believe in God and the Last Day––and ensure that a group of believers witnesses the punishment.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلزَّانِيَةُ","en_gloss":"The fornicatress","transliteration":"al-zāniyatu","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَٱلزَّانِى","en_gloss":"and the fornicator","transliteration":"wal-zānī","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَٱجْلِدُوا۟","en_gloss":"[then] flog","transliteration":"fa-ij'lidū","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كُلَّ","en_gloss":"each","transliteration":"kulla","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٰحِدٍۢ","en_gloss":"one","transliteration":"wāḥidin","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِّنْهُمَا","en_gloss":"of them","transliteration":"min'humā","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِا۟ئَةَ","en_gloss":"(with) hundred","transliteration":"mi-ata","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":8,"ar":"جَلْدَةٍۢ ۖ","en_gloss":"lash(es)","transliteration":"jaldatin","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (let) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":10,"ar":"تَأْخُذْكُم","en_gloss":"withhold you","transliteration":"takhudh'kum","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِهِمَا","en_gloss":"pity for them","transliteration":"bihimā","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":12,"ar":"رَأْفَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"pity for them","transliteration":"rafatun","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"concerning","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":14,"ar":"دِينِ","en_gloss":"(the) religion of Allah","transliteration":"dīni","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(the) religion of Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":16,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":17,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":18,"ar":"تُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"tu'minūna","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":19,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":20,"ar":"وَٱلْيَوْمِ","en_gloss":"and the Day","transliteration":"wal-yawmi","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":21,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ ۖ","en_gloss":"the Last","transliteration":"l-ākhiri","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":22,"ar":"وَلْيَشْهَدْ","en_gloss":"And let witness","transliteration":"walyashhad","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":23,"ar":"عَذَابَهُمَا","en_gloss":"their punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābahumā","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":24,"ar":"طَآئِفَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"a group","transliteration":"ṭāifatun","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":25,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":26,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"the believers","transliteration":"l-mu'minīna","verse_key":"24:2"},{"pos":27,"ar":"٢","en_gloss":"(2)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"24:2"}]},{"verse_key":"24:3","surah":24,"ayah":3,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلزَّانِى لَا يَنكِحُ إِلَّا زَانِيَةً أَوْ مُشْرِكَةً وَٱلزَّانِيَةُ لَا يَنكِحُهَآ إِلَّا زَانٍ أَوْ مُشْرِكٌ ۚ وَحُرِّمَ ذَٰلِكَ عَلَى ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The adulterer is only [fit] to marry an adulteress or an idolatress, and the adulteress is only [fit] to marry an adulterer or an idolater: such behaviour is forbidden to believers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلزَّانِى","en_gloss":"The fornicator","transliteration":"al-zānī","verse_key":"24:3"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(will) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"24:3"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَنكِحُ","en_gloss":"marry","transliteration":"yankiḥu","verse_key":"24:3"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"24:3"},{"pos":5,"ar":"زَانِيَةً","en_gloss":"a fornicatress","transliteration":"zāniyatan","verse_key":"24:3"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"24:3"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مُشْرِكَةًۭ","en_gloss":"a polytheist woman","transliteration":"mush'rikatan","verse_key":"24:3"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَٱلزَّانِيَةُ","en_gloss":"and the fornicatress ","transliteration":"wal-zāniyatu","verse_key":"24:3"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(will) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"24:3"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَنكِحُهَآ","en_gloss":"marry her","transliteration":"yankiḥuhā","verse_key":"24:3"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"24:3"},{"pos":12,"ar":"زَانٍ","en_gloss":"a fornicator","transliteration":"zānin","verse_key":"24:3"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"24:3"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مُشْرِكٌۭ ۚ","en_gloss":"a polytheist man","transliteration":"mush'rikun","verse_key":"24:3"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَحُرِّمَ","en_gloss":"And is forbidden","transliteration":"waḥurrima","verse_key":"24:3"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"24:3"},{"pos":17,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"24:3"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"the believers","transliteration":"l-mu'minīna","verse_key":"24:3"},{"pos":19,"ar":"٣","en_gloss":"(3)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"24:3"}]},{"verse_key":"24:4","surah":24,"ayah":4,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ يَرْمُونَ ٱلْمُحْصَنَـٰتِ ثُمَّ لَمْ يَأْتُوا۟ بِأَرْبَعَةِ شُهَدَآءَ فَٱجْلِدُوهُمْ ثَمَـٰنِينَ جَلْدَةً وَلَا تَقْبَلُوا۟ لَهُمْ شَهَـٰدَةً أَبَدًا ۚ وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْفَـٰسِقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"As for those who accuse chaste women of fornication, and then fail to provide four witnesses, strike them eighty times, and reject their testimony ever afterwards: they are the lawbreakers,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"24:4"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَرْمُونَ","en_gloss":"accuse","transliteration":"yarmūna","verse_key":"24:4"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْمُحْصَنَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"the chaste women","transliteration":"l-muḥ'ṣanāti","verse_key":"24:4"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"24:4"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَمْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"24:4"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَأْتُوا۟","en_gloss":"they bring","transliteration":"yatū","verse_key":"24:4"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِأَرْبَعَةِ","en_gloss":"four","trans