","verse_key":"24:7"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٧","en_gloss":"(7)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"24:7"}]},{"verse_key":"24:8","surah":24,"ayah":8,"ar_uthmani":"وَيَدْرَؤُا۟ عَنْهَا ٱلْعَذَابَ أَن تَشْهَدَ أَرْبَعَ شَهَـٰدَٰتٍۭ بِٱللَّهِ ۙ إِنَّهُۥ لَمِنَ ٱلْكَـٰذِبِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"punishment shall be averted from his wife if she in turn four times calls God to witness that her husband is lying","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَيَدْرَؤُا۟","en_gloss":"But it would prevent","transliteration":"wayadra-u","verse_key":"24:8"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَنْهَا","en_gloss":"from her","transliteration":"ʿanhā","verse_key":"24:8"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابَ","en_gloss":"the punishment","transliteration":"l-ʿadhāba","verse_key":"24:8"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"24:8"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَشْهَدَ","en_gloss":"she bears witness","transliteration":"tashhada","verse_key":"24:8"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَرْبَعَ","en_gloss":"four","transliteration":"arbaʿa","verse_key":"24:8"},{"pos":7,"ar":"شَهَـٰدَٰتٍۭ","en_gloss":"testimonies","transliteration":"shahādātin","verse_key":"24:8"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ ۙ","en_gloss":"by Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"24:8"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"that he","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"24:8"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَمِنَ","en_gloss":"(is) surely of","transliteration":"lamina","verse_key":"24:8"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْكَـٰذِبِينَ","en_gloss":"the liars","transliteration":"l-kādhibīna","verse_key":"24:8"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٨","en_gloss":"(8)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"24:8"}]},{"verse_key":"24:9","surah":24,"ayah":9,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلْخَـٰمِسَةَ أَنَّ غَضَبَ ٱللَّهِ عَلَيْهَآ إِن كَانَ مِنَ ٱلصَّـٰدِقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and, the fifth time, calls God to reject her if he is telling the truth.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلْخَـٰمِسَةَ","en_gloss":"And the fifth","transliteration":"wal-khāmisata","verse_key":"24:9"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliterati